#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:15
msgid "🌟 What is GSA (HATA)?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:17
msgid ""
"**GSA** (Geometry Sparse Attention) is a groundbreaking sparse attention "
"algorithm that revolutionizes large language model inference through "
"**Hash-Aware Top-k Attention**. Published at ACL 2025, our method "
"achieves unprecedented efficiency by intelligently selecting the most "
"relevant kv cache blocks using trainable hash-based similarity "
"computation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:19
msgid "🎯 Key Innovations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:21
msgid ""
"**🔍 Hash-Aware Similarity**: Uses trainable hash functions to compute "
"attention relevance, which is significantly faster than exact attention "
"score $QK$ computation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:22
msgid ""
"**⚡ Hardware-Efficient**: Optimized for both CUDA and NPU architectures "
"with specialized kernels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:23
msgid ""
"**🎛️ Adaptive Sparsity**: Layer-wise sparsity ratios that adapt to model "
"characteristics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:24
msgid ""
"**🔄 Dynamic Retrieval**: Real-time **query-aware** block selection based "
"on query-key similarity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:25
msgid ""
"**💾 Memory-Efficient**: Dramatically reduces KV cache HBM peak usage by "
"leveraing UCM's offloading capability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:27
msgid "🔥 Key Results"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:28
msgid "**3-5x speedup** in attention computation for long sequences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:29
msgid "**Minimal accuracy loss** (< 2%) on downstream tasks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md:30
msgid "**Scalable to 128K+ context lengths** with linear complexity"
msgstr ""

